		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">The algebraic phylogenetics database</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://algebraicphylogenetics.org</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">This website presents an algebraic classification of small tree and network models in phylogenetics. It currently hosts data on twentysix trees, paired with five different model types. These are listed in the table on the landing page. Mathematical details can be found on individual subpages for each tree and model. Algebraic phylogenetics is a subfield of Algebraic Statistics, with MSC identifiers 62R01, 65H10, 92D15, 68W30, and 14Q30. The page Notions and notation gives a mathematical introduction to the topic.
The website is available under an MIT License https://github.com/chgoergen/algebraicphylogeneticsorg, the corresponding software package under the GNU public license https://github.com/bkholler/Oscar.jl</r3d:description>
